# Events Spec

Read `.cursor/skills/eva-specs/events.md` (full: `E.V.A./docs/EVENT_SPEC_v0.1.md`).

- Event = fact, not command; FSM decides response
- Envelope: `id`, `type`, `version`, `source`, `timestamp`, `correlation`, `payload`, `metadata`, `causation_id`
- Naming: `<domain>.<entity>.<past_tense_verb>` (e.g. `channel.message.received`)
- `correlation` links context; `causation_id` chains direct cause
- Dedup on stable `id`; at-least-once delivery
